### ========================================
### ÓRDENES - /api/orders
### Reemplaza <TOKEN> con el token del login
### ========================================

### Crear orden
### Requiere: cliente activo con crédito, productos con stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "supplierId": 1,
  "notes": "Orden urgente",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 5000.00
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 12000.00
    }
  ]
}

### Obtener orden por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Obtener orden por número
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/number/ORD-2024-001
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar todas las órdenes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar órdenes por cliente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/customer/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar órdenes por estado (PENDING, COMPLETED, CANCELLED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/status/PENDING
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar órdenes pendientes de un cliente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/customer/1/pending
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Buscar órdenes por rango de fechas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/search?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Completar orden (cambia estado a COMPLETED)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Cancelar orden (revierte stock y saldo pendiente del cliente)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
